<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SBS Tech a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SBS Tech a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen said it started coverage of SBS Technologies Inc as a strong buy with a six to 12 month price target of $33-36.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 24.</p>
</text>
